WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.533
House Speaker

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:02.002
Kevin McCarthy is following

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.970
through on one of his promises

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.972
to retaliate against Democrats

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:06.973
who voted to remove

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:09.109
two Republicans from House committees

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:10.543
back in 2021.

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:12.746
Now that he has the gavel, McCarthy

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:13.747
this week

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:15.148
removed two Democrats

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:16.082
from a key committee

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.851
and is working on a third.

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:20.353
All three of those Democrats join me now,

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.721
Congresswoman Ilhan

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:22.822
Omar of Minnesota

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.557
and Congressman Adam Schiff

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:27.093
and Eric Swalwell of California.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.962
Thank you one and all for joining me.

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:29.662
I appreciate it.

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:31.231
I know that there's a lot to talk about

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:32.899
in terms of the politics

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:34.000
of what's happening here,

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:34.734
but I want to air out

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.603
some of the substance

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:38.371
of the Republican allegations.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:41.307
And Congressman, I'll start with you

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:43.710
You said that there was direct evidence

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:45.111
of the fact

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:45.879
that Donald Trump

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.181
colluded with Russia back in 2016.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:49.315
Special Counsel

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:51.484
Robert Mueller said in his report quote

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:53.319
The investigation did not establish

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:54.387
that members

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:54.854
of the Trump

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:56.890
campaign conspired or coordinated

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.525
with the Russian government.

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:00.693
Republicans argue that's proof

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:02.195
that you used your position

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:03.430
on the Intelligence Committee

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:05.799
to intentionally mislead Americans,

00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:06.399
which is why

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:09.002
you should not be on that committee.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.403
If you read the Mueller report,

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:11.371
he makes clear,

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:12.572
even in the first few pages

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.074
of the report, that he states

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:15.008
no conclusion

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:16.876
on whether Donald Trump and his campaign

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:18.445
colluded with the Russians.

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:19.913
But what he does reveal in this report,

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:21.815
what we found in our investigation

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:22.715
is that Donald Trump's

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:24.484
campaign manager was sharing

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:26.619
internal campaign polling data

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:27.454
and the strategy

00:01:27.454 --> 00:01:29.089
for key battleground states

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:31.357
with an agent of Russian intelligence

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:32.659
while that same unit of Russian

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:34.494
intelligence was helping

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:36.062
the Trump campaign,

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:36.863
both with the hacking

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:38.431
and dumping operation,

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:40.533
as well as a social media operation

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:42.802
to elect Donald Trump to most Americans.

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:44.137
That is collusion.

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:45.171
Now, whether it's proof

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:45.872
beyond reasonable doubt

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.140
of the crime of conspiracy,

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:47.841
that's what Bob

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.142
Mueller was talking about.

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:51.244
I've always distinguish between the two.

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:52.712
But but let me just,

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.714
you know, set the record straight.

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:57.617
This is only one of a shifting series

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:59.819
of rationalizations and pretexts

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:00.987
that McCarthy is using.

00:02:00.987 --> 00:02:02.589
Well, let me let me give you another.

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:03.556
He says that

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:05.658
this is part

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:06.960
of a pattern

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.495
ahead of the first Trump impeachment.

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:10.029
You said the committee had not spoken

00:02:10.029 --> 00:02:11.164
to a whistleblower.

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:13.133
In fact, that turned out not to be true.

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:13.266
You know,

00:02:13.266 --> 00:02:14.868
The Washington Post

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:17.203
said so in their factcheck.

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:20.006
The Washington Post identified that, yes,

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:21.975
before the person became a whistleblower,

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:24.244
they sought advice from the committee.

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:25.178
When I was asked the question,

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:26.212
I thought they were referring to

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:26.679
whether we had

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:28.715
brought the whistleblower in.

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:29.682
And I should have been

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:31.284
more clear in my answer.

00:02:31.284 --> 00:02:32.852
But but again, let's be clear

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:34.754
what's really going on here.

00:02:34.754 --> 00:02:37.357
McCarthy has said Adam Schiff prosecuted

00:02:37.357 --> 00:02:39.459
the case against Trump Ukraine

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:41.294
Impeachment was a hoax.

00:02:41.294 --> 00:02:43.429
You know, he's given 15 explanations.

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:45.431
The only real explanation is

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:47.967
he needs Marjorie Taylor Greene vote in.

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:49.736
It's Paul Gosar. Is vote.

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:51.704
He wants to retaliate for their removal

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:52.772
from the committee.

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:54.274
And apparently,

00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:56.209
he believes I was very effective

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:58.011
in exposing his misconduct.

00:02:58.011 --> 00:02:59.946
Donald Trump's misconduct.

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:01.881
And that's what they're trying to stop.

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:02.982
So, you know,

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:05.785
I think that he benefits from having

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:08.221
these smears repeated

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:10.456
And that's part of what he gains from it.

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:13.092
But this is a pretext and nothing more.

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:14.394
And which is why

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:17.230
this is a chance for you to explain

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:18.998
and to give your side of that

00:03:18.998 --> 00:03:21.000
as opposed to just simply repeating it

00:03:21.434 --> 00:03:22.402
on that.

00:03:22.402 --> 00:03:24.671
Congressman, you were also removed

00:03:24.671 --> 00:03:25.505
by Republicans

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:26.773
from the Intelligence Committee

00:03:26.773 --> 00:03:28.841
with the speaker said about you.

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:30.643
Is that beginning in 2012,

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.212
a suspected Chinese

00:03:32.212 --> 00:03:33.813
spy develop ties to you

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:36.482
and to your office, even put an intern

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:38.851
there, raise campaign funds for you.

00:03:39.252 --> 00:03:41.221
You say very clearly you cut off ties

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:42.021
with this person

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:43.289
back in 20, 15

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:44.023
when you found out

00:03:44.023 --> 00:03:45.925
you cooperated with the FBI.

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:48.194
But the bottom line question is this

00:03:48.628 --> 00:03:49.729
did you put yourself

00:03:49.729 --> 00:03:52.532
in a vulnerable position in any way

00:03:52.832 --> 00:03:55.068
so that this alleged Chinese spy

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:56.469
could have benefited

00:03:56.469 --> 00:03:58.838
or even learn American secrets?

00:03:59.172 --> 00:04:00.273
Absolutely not.

00:04:00.273 --> 00:04:02.475
But, Dana, don't take my word for it.

00:04:03.109 --> 00:04:04.310
Take the FBI's word for it.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:05.545
They never

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:07.080
talk about ongoing investigations

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.249
and former Chairman Schiff knows this

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:11.084
as a member of the Gang of Eight.

00:04:11.084 --> 00:04:12.352
Three different times

00:04:12.352 --> 00:04:14.387
they came out and said two things.

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:16.289
All I did was help them.

00:04:16.289 --> 00:04:16.956
And also,

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:18.024
I was never under

00:04:18.024 --> 00:04:19.559
any suspicion of wrongdoing.

00:04:19.559 --> 00:04:20.893
But more than that,

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:21.628
Chairman,

00:04:21.628 --> 00:04:22.128
Speaker

00:04:22.128 --> 00:04:23.329
Boehner was briefed

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:24.664
on this investigation.

00:04:24.664 --> 00:04:25.531
He could have removed me

00:04:25.531 --> 00:04:27.233
just as Speaker McCarthy did.

00:04:27.233 --> 00:04:28.001
He didn't.

00:04:28.034 --> 00:04:28.801
Devin Nunes

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:29.636
was the chair

00:04:29.636 --> 00:04:30.870
of the Intelligence Committee.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:33.273
Never made a public peep about this.

00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:34.440
Paul Ryan would have access

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:35.875
to the same investigation.

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:37.644
Reappointed me to the committee.

00:04:37.644 --> 00:04:38.311
Donald Trump,

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:40.580
who villainized me at every rally.

00:04:41.014 --> 00:04:42.715
More access to classified information

00:04:42.715 --> 00:04:44.417
than any person who walked the earth.

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:45.451
If he could have weaponized

00:04:45.451 --> 00:04:46.619
that to go after me

00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:47.954
you know, he would have.

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:49.689
There's nothing there.

00:04:49.689 --> 00:04:51.524
I did what every American should have.

00:04:51.524 --> 00:04:53.393
This is some Bakersfield B.S.

00:04:53.393 --> 00:04:54.727
It's Kevin McCarthy

00:04:54.727 --> 00:04:56.696
weaponizing his ability

00:04:56.696 --> 00:04:58.264
to commit this political abuse

00:04:58.264 --> 00:04:59.799
because he perceives me just like Mr.

00:04:59.799 --> 00:05:00.333
Schiff and MS.

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:02.869
Omar as an effective political opponent.

00:05:02.935 --> 00:05:04.103
Well, let me ask you,

00:05:04.103 --> 00:05:05.405
Congresswoman Omar,

00:05:05.405 --> 00:05:06.839
about what Republicans

00:05:06.839 --> 00:05:08.608
are saying about you,

00:05:08.608 --> 00:05:11.311
that there is a pattern of anti-Semitic

00:05:11.311 --> 00:05:13.179
and other controversial statements

00:05:13.179 --> 00:05:15.481
that make you unfit to sit on.

00:05:15.481 --> 00:05:16.082
In your case,

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:17.850
the House Foreign Affairs Committee.

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:19.052
I'm told that Republicans

00:05:19.052 --> 00:05:21.287
presented a list in their meeting,

00:05:21.287 --> 00:05:23.823
in their private meeting this past week.

00:05:23.823 --> 00:05:25.191
Included in that list

00:05:25.191 --> 00:05:26.192
is that you said that

00:05:26.192 --> 00:05:28.127
Israel hypnotized the world.

00:05:28.127 --> 00:05:30.196
You said Israel is an apartheid regime,

00:05:30.463 --> 00:05:33.032
that politicians with pro-Israel stance

00:05:33.032 --> 00:05:35.234
or stances were all about the Benjamins,

00:05:35.268 --> 00:05:38.171
which you very notably apologized for,

00:05:39.472 --> 00:05:40.840
that you support the BDS

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.642
movement, which a lot of people think

00:05:42.642 --> 00:05:44.777
is rooted in anti-Semitism.

00:05:44.777 --> 00:05:46.879
Compare the US and Israel to Hamas

00:05:46.879 --> 00:05:47.880
and the Taliban.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:48.915
I want to give you a chance

00:05:48.915 --> 00:05:50.183
to respond

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:50.850
to all of that,

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:53.319
which they say is a clear pattern.

00:05:53.319 --> 00:05:56.923
Yeah, I might have used words

00:05:56.923 --> 00:05:58.591
at the time that I didn't understand

00:05:58.591 --> 00:06:01.761
were trafficking in anti-Semitism.

00:06:02.528 --> 00:06:04.230
When that was brought to my attention,

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.898
I apologize I owned up to it.

00:06:05.898 --> 00:06:07.967
That's the kind of person that I am,

00:06:07.967 --> 00:06:09.969
and I continue to work with my colleagues

00:06:09.969 --> 00:06:11.371
and my community

00:06:11.371 --> 00:06:13.940
to fight against antisemitism.

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.409
Now I've never compared

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:19.379
or made any comparisons.

00:06:19.379 --> 00:06:20.213
What I was

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:21.414
referencing was a case

00:06:21.414 --> 00:06:24.183
that was in front of the ICC

00:06:24.183 --> 00:06:25.685
and if they want to debate

00:06:25.685 --> 00:06:27.754
political differences, and

00:06:28.888 --> 00:06:30.990
that's something that we should all have

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.258
the opportunity

00:06:32.258 --> 00:06:35.395
to to do so, but to smear someone

00:06:36.062 --> 00:06:37.663
and their their character,

00:06:37.663 --> 00:06:39.432
their love for their country

00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:41.734
and the work that they get to do

00:06:41.734 --> 00:06:43.970
on a committee is is wrong.

00:06:44.303 --> 00:06:46.606
And it is politically motivated

00:06:47.306 --> 00:06:49.275
and in some cases is motivated

00:06:49.275 --> 00:06:51.310
by the fact that many of these members

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:54.347
don't believe a Muslim

00:06:54.347 --> 00:06:56.616
refugee, an African

00:06:56.616 --> 00:06:58.251
should even be in Congress,

00:06:58.251 --> 00:07:00.420
let alone have the opportunity

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.121
to serve on the floor before.

00:07:02.121 --> 00:07:02.455
I mean,

00:07:02.455 --> 00:07:03.623
it sounds like you're accusing

00:07:03.623 --> 00:07:06.025
Kevin McCarthy of racism.

00:07:06.025 --> 00:07:09.529
I mean, I'm not making any accusations.

00:07:09.529 --> 00:07:11.764
I'm just laying out the facts.

00:07:11.764 --> 00:07:13.433
You remember Donald Trump

00:07:13.433 --> 00:07:16.502
coming into my state and saying Muslims,

00:07:16.803 --> 00:07:18.404
Somali refugees

00:07:18.404 --> 00:07:20.606
are infiltrating our country.

00:07:20.606 --> 00:07:22.575
You remember Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:07:22.575 --> 00:07:24.277
coming to Congress after Washington?

00:07:24.277 --> 00:07:26.312
I got sworn in and saying

00:07:26.479 --> 00:07:28.948
Muslims are infiltrating Congress.

00:07:29.148 --> 00:07:30.683
You remember Boebert

00:07:30.683 --> 00:07:33.186
saying that I was a terrorist?

00:07:33.419 --> 00:07:34.754
What did McCarthy do?

00:07:34.754 --> 00:07:35.955
He said she apologized

00:07:35.955 --> 00:07:37.190
and we don't have to worry about

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:38.191
her Islamophobia.

00:07:39.459 --> 00:07:40.893
That never happened.

00:07:40.893 --> 00:07:42.862
And so these people are okay

00:07:42.862 --> 00:07:44.564
with Islamophobia.

00:07:44.564 --> 00:07:45.298
They're okay

00:07:45.298 --> 00:07:46.299
with trafficking

00:07:46.299 --> 00:07:48.634
in their own ways and antisemitism.

00:07:48.901 --> 00:07:51.103
They are not okay with having a Muslim

00:07:51.103 --> 00:07:52.772
have a voice on that committee.

00:07:52.772 --> 00:07:53.806
Let me ask you, Congressman,

00:07:53.806 --> 00:07:57.076
you are Jewish, and you have said

00:07:57.376 --> 00:08:01.280
that you were worried about some tropes

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:04.484
that the congressman used

00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:06.519
and which again, I want to be clear.

00:08:06.519 --> 00:08:08.221
You apologize for that, for that one

00:08:08.221 --> 00:08:10.056
all about the Benjamins.

00:08:10.056 --> 00:08:12.258
Do you believe

00:08:12.258 --> 00:08:15.294
that the pattern that your colleague here

00:08:15.294 --> 00:08:16.062
has put out there

00:08:16.062 --> 00:08:18.297
is, as Republicans are saying,

00:08:18.297 --> 00:08:20.132
and some Democrats say,

00:08:20.132 --> 00:08:22.668
rise to the level of antisemitism

00:08:22.668 --> 00:08:24.036
then I believe that

00:08:24.036 --> 00:08:25.872
this is all a pretext.

00:08:25.872 --> 00:08:27.840
And if you look at

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:30.142
the leader of the Republican Party,

00:08:30.142 --> 00:08:32.645
Donald Trump, he is dining

00:08:32.678 --> 00:08:35.248
with white nationalists and anti-Semites.

00:08:35.882 --> 00:08:37.116
The people that Kevin McCarthy

00:08:37.116 --> 00:08:38.150
just put on committees

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:38.918
like Marjorie Taylor

00:08:38.918 --> 00:08:41.254
Greene and others are speaking at white

00:08:41.254 --> 00:08:42.355
nationalist rallies

00:08:43.789 --> 00:08:44.724
This is,

00:08:44.724 --> 00:08:45.024
you know,

00:08:45.024 --> 00:08:47.660
as my colleague said, Bakersfield B.S.

00:08:48.027 --> 00:08:49.595
This is all pretextual.

00:08:49.595 --> 00:08:51.597
And I don't accept the premise

00:08:51.597 --> 00:08:52.498
that this has anything

00:08:52.498 --> 00:08:53.499
to do with the conduct

00:08:53.499 --> 00:08:55.568
of any of the Democratic members.

00:08:55.568 --> 00:08:58.137
This is merely the weakness of Kevin

00:08:58.137 --> 00:09:00.172
McCarthy speakership that is so reliant

00:09:00.606 --> 00:09:01.741
on these extreme members.

00:09:01.741 --> 00:09:04.010
I mean, how can you, on the one hand,

00:09:05.011 --> 00:09:06.913
suggest that

00:09:06.913 --> 00:09:09.015
these are some kind of legitimate basis

00:09:09.015 --> 00:09:11.884
for unseating Democrats on committees

00:09:12.318 --> 00:09:13.653
and put someone like George

00:09:13.653 --> 00:09:15.121
Santos on any committee?

00:09:15.121 --> 00:09:16.589
The hypocrisy just grabbed you

00:09:16.589 --> 00:09:17.490
by the throat.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.926
So I don't want to dignify the pretext

00:09:19.926 --> 00:09:22.128
that they're giving for any of us.

00:09:22.128 --> 00:09:22.762
What they're doing

00:09:22.762 --> 00:09:25.698
is really catering to the most

00:09:25.698 --> 00:09:27.333
extreme members of their conference.

00:09:27.333 --> 00:09:29.235
I just I do, though, want to ask, because

00:09:31.003 --> 00:09:31.971
this has been out

00:09:31.971 --> 00:09:32.738
there

00:09:32.805 --> 00:09:34.473
and it is definitely

00:09:34.473 --> 00:09:35.741
a big issue that we were going.

00:09:35.741 --> 00:09:36.208
We're going to hear

00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:37.710
a lot more about on the House floor

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:39.478
next week, Congresswoman.

00:09:39.478 --> 00:09:41.280
So when you apologized

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:41.881
for that all

00:09:41.881 --> 00:09:43.249
about the Benjamins

00:09:43.249 --> 00:09:44.150
button comment,

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:46.218
you said antisemitism is real.

00:09:46.218 --> 00:09:47.453
And I'm grateful for Jewish

00:09:47.453 --> 00:09:48.421
allies and colleagues

00:09:48.421 --> 00:09:49.555
who are educating me

00:09:49.555 --> 00:09:50.222
on the painful

00:09:50.222 --> 00:09:52.291
history of anti-Semitic tropes.

00:09:52.291 --> 00:09:53.893
What did you learn?

00:09:53.893 --> 00:09:55.094
A lot.

00:09:55.227 --> 00:09:58.030
I certainly did not or was not aware

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:01.033
that the word hypnotize was a trope

00:10:02.101 --> 00:10:05.771
I wasn't aware of, of the fact

00:10:05.771 --> 00:10:06.906
that there are tropes

00:10:06.906 --> 00:10:09.642
about Jews and money

00:10:09.642 --> 00:10:11.644
that has been a very enlightening

00:10:12.979 --> 00:10:15.648
part of of this journey

00:10:15.648 --> 00:10:19.819
to insinuate that I knowingly said

00:10:19.819 --> 00:10:20.686
these things

00:10:20.686 --> 00:10:23.856
when people have read into my comments

00:10:23.856 --> 00:10:24.724
to make it sound

00:10:24.724 --> 00:10:26.926
as if I have something against

00:10:26.926 --> 00:10:28.861
the Jewish community is so wrong.

00:10:28.861 --> 00:10:30.062
If you remember

00:10:30.062 --> 00:10:32.164
when I first got elected to Congress,

00:10:32.431 --> 00:10:34.834
it was when the FBI report came out

00:10:34.834 --> 00:10:36.802
and the rise of anti-Semitism

00:10:36.802 --> 00:10:40.339
as a rep elected the first op ed I wrote

00:10:40.506 --> 00:10:42.642
was on that report,

00:10:42.642 --> 00:10:43.843
which I talked about

00:10:43.843 --> 00:10:45.978
how it was important for us

00:10:45.978 --> 00:10:48.648
as a community to coalesce around

00:10:48.648 --> 00:10:49.649
the Jewish community

00:10:49.649 --> 00:10:51.984
and fight against antisemitism.

00:10:51.984 --> 00:10:55.121
I voted for every single resolution.

00:10:55.121 --> 00:10:56.922
No Republican can say that

00:10:56.922 --> 00:10:58.858
condemning anti-Semitism.

